{"3189720": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Feral Scape", "steam_appid": 3189720, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189720/extras/1cd0af17b209e085dcdcd45b0d42482d.avif?t=1785380139\" width=732 height=151 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feral Scape is a single-player open-world dark fantasy RPG set in a strange world inspired by Australian landscapes. Explore as a feral animal and uncover the creatures, settlements and forces competing to shape the land.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build a Life in the Wild</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources, craft useful tools, develop your skills and build a place for yourself within the world. Your decisions influence how you explore and which opportunities become available.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Navigate Three Rival Factions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build relationships with three factions and their leaders, each offering a different vision for the future. Decide who to trust, what to support and which promises may carry hidden consequences.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create and Experiment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the game’s creative tools to edit and load player-created content. These systems will continue to develop throughout Early Access alongside the world, stories and progression.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189720/extras/1cd0af17b209e085dcdcd45b0d42482d.avif?t=1785380139\" width=732 height=151 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feral Scape is a single-player open-world dark fantasy RPG set in a strange world inspired by Australian landscapes. Explore as a feral animal and uncover the creatures, settlements and forces competing to shape the land.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build a Life in the Wild</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources, craft useful tools, develop your skills and build a place for yourself within the world. Your decisions influence how you explore and which opportunities become available.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Navigate Three Rival Factions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build relationships with three factions and their leaders, each offering a different vision for the future. Decide who to trust, what to support and which promises may carry hidden consequences.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create and Experiment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the game’s creative tools to edit and load player-created content. These systems will continue to develop throughout Early Access alongside the world, stories and progression.</p>", "short_description": "Feral Scape is a single-player open-world dark fantasy RPG set in a strange wilderness inspired by Australia. Explore as a feral animal, gather resources, craft tools, build a place in the world and form relationships with three rival factions as your choices affect the story.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189720/ebebd8f62bb2c099aed349e79a3e2edf979ab718/header.jpg?t=1785380139", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189720/00b32e6a6c651852a6473dbdac54c19bc5372cb4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785380139", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189720/00b32e6a6c651852a6473dbdac54c19bc5372cb4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785380139", "website": "https://barchboi.neocities.org/feralscape", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Winsows 10 (64bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual-core processor, 2.0 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DirectX 512mb compatible graphics<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 800 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or 11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad Core, 2GHz+<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DirectX 1GB compatible graphics<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M2 Pro chip<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM</li></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM</li></ul>"}, "developers": ["BARCHboi"], "publishers": ["BARCHboi"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 17, "description": "Includes level editor"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "25", "description": "Adventure"}, {"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}, {"id": "3", "description": "RPG"}, {"id": "28", "description": "Simulation"}, {"id": "70", "description": "Early Access"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189720/f1eaf22d3ad50755b8eeee3553f4f8a94cbb75e1/ss_f1eaf22d3ad50755b8eeee3553f4f8a94cbb75e1.600x338.jpg?t=1785380139", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189720/f1eaf22d3ad50755b8eeee3553f4f8a94cbb75e1/ss_f1eaf22d3ad50755b8eeee3553f4f8a94cbb75e1.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785380139"}, {"id": 1, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/st